source: crates/rune-config/tests/eval.rs
description: a config reaching for console
expression: "refusal_for(\"console\")"
---
rune.config.ts failed while it was being evaluated as a rune config

`console` is not available in a rune config.

rune evaluates this file to produce a result, not to run it, so there is nothing to print to.

to see what a script resolved to, run:
  rune inspect <name>
